WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
In AI Mode, Britjoy uses a language model to talk with you in English and explain what you are unsure about. Remember what you learned: a language model predicts continuations; it can sound confident and be wrong.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:32.000
For rules, money, health or paperwork, always check the official source (GOV.UK, NHS). Do not type personal data: no passwords, no passport or account numbers, no share code. Use it to practise: ask for corrections, examples and practice conversations.

3
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:48.000
The AI gives you a Council Tax figure that does not match what you read on GOV.UK. Your task: decide which one to follow and why. Hint: generating text and checking a fact are different tasks.

4
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.200
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
